DESCRIPTION:Fahim Anwar is a Los Angeles-based standup comedian\, actor and
  writer. Fahim is touring on the heels of his third stand up special\, “H
 ouse Money.” His previous special "Hat Trick" filmed at the World Famous 
 Comedy Store was named one of the best specials of the year by the LA Times
 . The New York Times has listed Fahim as a "Most Promising Future Star." He
 's appeared on CONAN\, LATE NIGHT WITH SETH MEYERS and performed at the pre
 stigious Just for Laughs Festival in Montreal. His recent FILM/TV credits i
 nclude WHISKEY TANGO FOXTROT opposite Tina Fey\, NEIGHBORS\, DRUNK HISTORY 
